		{
			"type": "action",
			"name": "Horrifying Visage",
			"system": {
				"actionType": {
					"value": "free"
				},
				"description": {
					"value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The will-o'-wisp swarm is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{invisible}</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The will-o'-wisp swarm reveals itself, losing its invisibility for 1 round. Each creature within @Template[type:emanation|distance:60] must make a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p><p>Regardless of their result, the targets become immune to Horrifying Visage for 24 hours.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.<br /><strong>Success</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.<br /><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[5d8[mental]] damage, and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.<br /><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[8d8[mental]] damage, and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}.</p>",
					"gm": "<p>Players who have played the Adventure Path Abomination Vaults treat their character's degree of success as one degree worse than their roll.</p>"
				},
